Z||000000||Boodoggin||05-04-2000||06:10 PM||||Any one live in Caifornia??  Maybe someone could go check this out.......<P>Phone: 9492400795<BR>1985 Pontiac Fiero $3000 <BR>This Car's Details <BR>Mileage 54000 <BR>Exterior Color Silver <BR> <BR>Comments <BR>This car is equipped with a Garrett T03B Turbo charger and a Garrett High Performance intercooler. This very fast car also has an Electromotive TEC II performance computer and has been featured in Turbo Magazine as a Reader's Project. The body is in excellent condition with 54,000 miles. color: Silver <BR> ||||reg||2
